==== GOLDEN ARTEFACT p5/small/p5_report_discovery.txt | bytes=12926 | sha256=576b4bcb11c21c5bd5ef79b587b7bd4c39120fd2d383ae6b87b055199a0cec50 | text
#702 P5 - the holdout read's PRIMARY (his exit with the stalled breakouts cut: c3_p33_t20_cut3) and the rows reported beside it - D 2022-03-28 .. 2024-12-31, DISCOVERY. Measurement only: nothing here chooses a level, an entry, a stop or an exit.
source: trades_discovery_p5.tsv.gz; rows read 12. POPULATION: the spec key's first breaks filled at orh5 under the registered stop (the low of the day at the fill, no wider than one ADR20), on tl / com / comb. A group is the MATURE walks only (n_open counted, never in a number); month-block bootstrap (2,000 draws, seed 702) 95% interval on the mean R; ADR = mean P&L in ADR20 x price units.
ARMS: c3_p33_t20_cut3 = sell 1/3 at +2R or at the close of session 3, whichever first; stop to breakeven; trail the rest to the first close under the 20-day average (filled at the next open); AND if the trade has not reached +1R by the close of session 3 (and was not stopped) everything is sold at that close ('cut'; 'held' = mean sessions held). Beside: p33_s3_t10 (the article: 1/3 at the close of session 3, 10-day trail), c3_p33_t20 (the same without the cut), r2_p33_t20 (+2R only, 20-day trail).

FILLED ENTRIES per level x cell (the primary arm's n_filled = fills with a walk; the registration's STEP 0 counts for the holdout)
