#702 DISCOVERY REPORT by regime - the headline table (entry orh5, arm p33_s3_t10) split by Apollo's daily regime at D. Reported BESIDE the report, never deciding; the non-Bull groups are small. source: trades_discovery.tsv.gz.
A cell is n / mean R / share >= 5R over the MATURE walks; `0` = no walk in that regime. missing = a D with no regime label.
